1
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:31,216
(Legend has it that in the early
Ming Dynasty, 300,000 taels)

2
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:33,330
(of gold were hidden
in the Hexi Corridor.)

3
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,936
(For years, 18 guardians of the gold)

4
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:38,660
(awaited treasure hunters
willing to risk their lives.)

5
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:33,620
(Lieyang Well)

6
00:01:59,264 --> 00:02:00,430
Deputy Military Commissioner.

7
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,480
Why aren't we riding horses?

8
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,680
We've already reached the Lieyang Well.

9
00:02:08,439 --> 00:02:10,599
But we'll still have to walk
to Shiquan Fort tomorrow.

10
00:02:11,319 --> 00:02:12,639
I don't really trust horses.

11
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:16,719
Can we trust them, then?

12
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:19,159
We paid them well.

13
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,360
They trust money.

14
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:24,800
Deputy Military Commissioner,
why hire outsiders?

15
00:02:24,810 --> 00:02:25,800
The Liangzhou Guard can...

16
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,520
Shut up.

17
00:02:31,984 --> 00:02:33,680
Does the General know
our Liangzhou Guard?

18
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,479
Shut up.

19
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,199
Shut up.

20
00:03:36,832 --> 00:03:38,840
Is there plenty of water
at Lieyang Well?

21
00:04:01,479 --> 00:04:02,560
My name is Bana.

22
00:04:03,199 --> 00:04:04,599
Seven horses, and fifteen men.

23
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:05,520
We'll stay half a day.

24
00:04:05,888 --> 00:04:07,904
We'll leave for Shiquan Fort
tomorrow morning.

25
00:04:08,759 --> 00:04:10,560
Shiquan Fort is deserted.

26
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:12,719
How did that happen?

27
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:17,800
Why?

28
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:26,279
There's said to be 300,000 taels
of gold somewhere in Gansu.

29
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:30,920
Really?

30
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:34,199
They say it was buried 30 years ago.

31
00:04:34,879 --> 00:04:36,199
Two months ago,

32
00:04:36,639 --> 00:04:39,839
a group of treasure hunters from
another garrison came to Shiquan Fort.

33
00:04:39,839 --> 00:04:41,720
They went mad
and became vengeful ghosts.

34
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,319
That's why Shiquan Fort was abandoned.

35
00:04:59,079 --> 00:05:00,120
Why would they suddenly

36
00:05:00,839 --> 00:05:02,040
turn into vengeful ghosts?

37
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:06,000
They say the guardians
of the gold did it.

38
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:11,199
Could Shiquan Fort

39
00:05:11,199 --> 00:05:12,839
be where the gold was buried?

40
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,079
I don't know.

41
00:05:32,839 --> 00:05:33,600
Bana,

42
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,519
this is your territory?

43
00:05:36,959 --> 00:05:38,240
In 30 years,

44
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:40,040
it's never been this deserted.

45
00:05:47,264 --> 00:05:49,920
We're going to Shiquan Fort
to find the guardians of the gold.

46
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,639
Either we become vengeful ghosts,

47
00:06:11,664 --> 00:06:13,240
or we capture one of the guardians

48
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:15,959
and ask where the 300,000 taels
of gold are actually buried.

49
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,800
What would you need that much gold for?

50
00:06:25,344 --> 00:06:27,310
Why bury that much gold
in the first place?

51
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,240
Stop!

52
00:08:19,879 --> 00:08:20,519
Fang.

53
00:08:23,199 --> 00:08:23,879
Fang.

54
00:08:25,879 --> 00:08:26,560
Fang.

55
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:27,560
Fang!

56
00:10:00,500 --> 00:10:02,848
=Remnants of Gold=

57
00:10:02,848 --> 00:10:06,100
(Adapted from Gu Long's
"Flying Eagle over the Great Land")

58
00:10:06,101 --> 00:10:09,300
(The main characters
in this drama are fictional)

59
00:10:09,300 --> 00:10:12,180
=Episode 1=

60
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:28,020
(Shaanxi Branch
Regional Military Commission)

61
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:40,320
General Ha.

62
00:10:55,399 --> 00:10:56,879
Let's just forget it.

63
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:01,279
Don't call me General.

64
00:11:02,799 --> 00:11:04,159
I, Ha Bingzhong,

65
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:06,120
am only a guerrilla commander.

66
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:09,320
In life, I serve the Commander-in-Chief.

67
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,519
In death, I remain loyal to him.

68
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,799
A guerrilla commander
is still a general.

69
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:18,000
It's all the same.

70
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,200
Yu Hou.

71
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:28,120
Do you know what kind of poison it was?

72
00:11:30,399 --> 00:11:31,519
The same poison.

73
00:11:32,919 --> 00:11:35,799
The Seven Riders of Mobei hired by Futu
brought their own horse feed.

74
00:11:35,872 --> 00:11:37,150
Earlier, outside the garrison,

75
00:11:37,159 --> 00:11:39,000
the treasure hunters
heading to Shiquan Fort

76
00:11:39,679 --> 00:11:41,559
were also poisoned through their fodder.

77
00:11:42,879 --> 00:11:44,759
What poison was it?

78
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:47,344
We've brought the horse feed back.

79
00:11:47,616 --> 00:11:49,150
We don't know what poison it was.

80
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:53,360
Trace the poison to its source,

81
00:11:53,919 --> 00:11:56,120
and we'll find
the guardians of the gold.

82
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:58,759
If we find them,

83
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:00,879
will that lead us to the gold?

84
00:12:05,279 --> 00:12:08,000
Do we have anyone here
who's skilled at identifying poisons?

85
00:12:09,639 --> 00:12:10,480
No.

86
00:12:12,039 --> 00:12:13,320
But at the Liangzhou Guard,

87
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,759
the Zhang Escort Agency

88
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:17,240
has a woman who married

89
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:19,600
(Zhang Escort Agency)
into the Tang Clan in Northern Shu.

90
00:12:20,159 --> 00:12:21,440
Word in the martial world

91
00:12:21,600 --> 00:12:22,559
is that this woman

92
00:12:22,799 --> 00:12:25,000
willingly became
a poison tester for the Tang Clan.

93
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,600
For three years,

94
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,679
she tested all manner of poisons.

95
00:12:28,679 --> 00:12:31,399
Would a married woman really willingly

96
00:12:31,639 --> 00:12:33,120
let others use her to test poisons?

97
00:12:33,879 --> 00:12:35,879
She fell off a cliff
while making her way

98
00:12:35,879 --> 00:12:37,360
along the Shu Road to her wedding.

99
00:12:37,559 --> 00:12:39,559
It took three days to pull her back up.

100
00:12:39,560 --> 00:12:42,250
By the time she reached the Tang Clan,
she was no longer of any use.

101
00:12:42,279 --> 00:12:44,320
She willingly tested poisons
for the Tang Clan.

102
00:12:44,519 --> 00:12:45,639
Three years have passed.

103
00:12:45,639 --> 00:12:48,279
She didn't die. Instead, she survived.

104
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:50,960
So,

105
00:12:51,279 --> 00:12:53,000
does this woman really exist?

106
00:12:53,639 --> 00:12:54,600
Yu Hou,

107
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:58,960
the Liangzhou Guard
is under your jurisdiction.

108
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:02,279
Futu, you know more about it than I do.

109
00:13:02,679 --> 00:13:03,360
That's right.

110
00:13:03,510 --> 00:13:06,336
The Zhang Escort Agency has a daughter
who married into the Tang Clan.

111
00:13:06,639 --> 00:13:08,000
Her name is Zhang Luyao.

112
00:13:09,559 --> 00:13:12,080
If we ask her to come back
and identify the poison,

113
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:13,799
how much would it take?

114
00:13:13,799 --> 00:13:15,519
A woman like her

115
00:13:15,519 --> 00:13:16,720
can't be persuaded

116
00:13:17,039 --> 00:13:18,000
with money.

117
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:23,000
What about 200 taels of gold?

118
00:13:23,919 --> 00:13:24,919
General,

119
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:26,360
isn't that rather generous?

120
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:28,559
Two hundred taels of gold.

121
00:13:29,639 --> 00:13:31,000
None for Zhang Luyao.

122
00:13:32,279 --> 00:13:33,639
Give it all to the Escort Agency.

123
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:44,200
Father.

124
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,399
The escort order says

125
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:46,600
to head west,

126
00:13:46,759 --> 00:13:48,960
first to Lieyang Well,

127
00:13:49,039 --> 00:13:50,600
and then to Shiquan Fort.

128
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,480
Was this just delivered?

129
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:54,600
Yes.

130
00:13:54,700 --> 00:13:56,110
The escort order says to head west,

131
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:57,200
first to Lieyang Well,

132
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:58,240
and then to Shiquan Fort,

133
00:13:58,519 --> 00:14:00,000
to guard 300,000 taels of gold.

134
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,279
And then?

135
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,720
Don't we still have the fodder

136
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:05,639
from the Seven Riders of Mobei?

137
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:12,919
Anyone who heads west for the gold

138
00:14:12,919 --> 00:14:16,080
could be poisoned
and become a vengeful ghost.

139
00:14:17,279 --> 00:14:19,200
Wouldn't that bring the woman back?

140
00:14:19,759 --> 00:14:20,919
When the time comes,

141
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:22,240
we can just ask the woman

142
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:24,639
where the poison came from, can't we?

143
00:14:25,879 --> 00:14:28,080
Will the Tang Clan let her leave?

144
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:29,639
It's been three years.

145
00:14:29,879 --> 00:14:33,000
She must have tested every poison
there was to test by now.

146
00:14:33,639 --> 00:14:34,600
Yu Hou,

147
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:38,080
wouldn't this make things much easier?

148
00:14:41,519 --> 00:14:42,759
General Ha, I don't understand

149
00:14:43,759 --> 00:14:44,799
what you mean.

150
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:47,039
Wait for the woman to come back

151
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:49,080
to mourn and identify the poison.

152
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:00,080
That will require

153
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:01,879
the Commander-in-Chief's decision.

154
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,440
Everything

155
00:15:05,159 --> 00:15:07,679
has to be decided by the General.

156
00:15:08,759 --> 00:15:09,879
I'll go ask.

157
00:15:17,279 --> 00:15:19,080
Where are the 300,000 taels of gold?

158
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:21,919
They said they'll pay another
200 taels at Shiquan Fort

159
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:23,759
to reveal where the gold is buried.

160
00:15:25,679 --> 00:15:26,200
Let's go.

161
00:15:28,399 --> 00:15:29,240
Master Zhang.

162
00:15:31,519 --> 00:15:32,240
Master Zhang.

163
00:15:36,879 --> 00:15:37,720
Everyone in Liangzhou

164
00:15:38,159 --> 00:15:39,120
knows that we

165
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:40,200
accepted 200 taels of gold

166
00:15:40,200 --> 00:15:41,240
and are heading west.

167
00:15:46,159 --> 00:15:48,080
Who accepted
the escort order and the gold?

168
00:15:49,919 --> 00:15:50,600
I did.

169
00:15:57,519 --> 00:15:58,960
Who delivered them?

170
00:15:59,559 --> 00:16:01,559
Two men with Shazhou accents.

171
00:16:14,639 --> 00:16:15,120
Quick.

172
00:16:16,240 --> 00:16:16,840
This way.

173
00:17:09,359 --> 00:17:10,480
What's going on?

174
00:17:24,279 --> 00:17:24,920
Luhao.

175
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:38,599
Father!

176
00:17:40,119 --> 00:17:40,799
Father.

177
00:17:42,799 --> 00:17:43,640
Luhao.

178
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:44,480
Father.

179
00:18:48,140 --> 00:18:53,940
(Shaanxi Branch
Regional Military Commission)

180
00:18:58,780 --> 00:19:02,500
(May Divine Might Protect Us Forever)

181
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:42,759
The General is feeling much better.

182
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:46,559
The Zhang lady has already left Shu

183
00:19:46,720 --> 00:19:48,160
and is on her way to Liangzhou.

184
00:19:53,079 --> 00:19:54,519
The imperial court has sent a man

185
00:19:54,720 --> 00:19:55,680
named Pu Ying.

186
00:19:55,696 --> 00:19:58,592
He's a seventh-rank Banner Commander
of the Embroidered Uniform Guard.

187
00:19:58,608 --> 00:20:01,310
He was sent to investigate the cases
at Shiquan Fort and Lieyang Well

188
00:20:01,310 --> 00:20:04,079
involving the poisoning and deaths of
treasure hunters. Now, he may

189
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:06,880
be heading to
the Zhang Escort Agency in Liangzhou.

190
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:09,240
Very good.

191
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:13,359
If we find the 300,000 taels
of gold, how do we split it?

192
00:20:14,559 --> 00:20:16,480
Quite a few people have already died.

193
00:20:17,119 --> 00:20:18,119
How do we split it?

194
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:23,880
How?

195
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:28,279
We do the work.

196
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:29,240
As for the riches,

197
00:20:29,759 --> 00:20:30,880
the General decides.

198
00:20:37,559 --> 00:20:38,839
The General

199
00:20:39,519 --> 00:20:41,640
won't even see me.

200
00:20:43,799 --> 00:20:46,519
Why does the General see you?

201
00:21:10,279 --> 00:21:11,599
Futu, you're highly skilled.

202
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:36,839
Not everyone at Lieyang Well died.

203
00:21:37,519 --> 00:21:39,119
There's still one survivor.

204
00:21:39,119 --> 00:21:40,000
Me.

205
00:21:40,799 --> 00:21:42,119
There was another one.

206
00:21:42,759 --> 00:21:43,839
A young fellow.

207
00:21:43,904 --> 00:21:46,110
Everyone went mad
and started killing each other.

208
00:21:46,176 --> 00:21:48,144
Only the best fighters
survived to the end.

209
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:49,839
Don't we need to silence him?

210
00:21:51,344 --> 00:21:53,568
He's one of my men
from the Liangzhou Guard.

211
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:57,319
Someone from the Zhang Escort Agency

212
00:21:58,279 --> 00:22:00,039
also survived.

213
00:22:00,960 --> 00:22:02,119
Find him and silence him

214
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:03,720
after returning to Liangzhou.

215
00:22:08,759 --> 00:22:09,680
Yu Hou,

216
00:22:10,920 --> 00:22:12,519
I'm talking to you.

217
00:22:12,519 --> 00:22:14,279
Why do you never look at me?

218
00:22:15,039 --> 00:22:15,960
I'm afraid.

219
00:22:19,920 --> 00:22:22,599
So even you are afraid of me.

220
00:22:25,839 --> 00:22:27,720
I'm afraid
that if I look at you too long,

221
00:22:28,680 --> 00:22:29,880
I'll kill you.

222
00:22:31,200 --> 00:22:33,279
But the General still needs you,

223
00:22:33,279 --> 00:22:35,359
so I try not to look at you.

224
00:22:39,480 --> 00:22:42,400
You think you can kill me?

225
00:22:45,088 --> 00:22:46,750
Guarding the Northwestern frontier,

226
00:22:47,168 --> 00:22:48,750
our lives are worth no more than weeds.

227
00:22:49,880 --> 00:22:51,319
Brave as you may be,

228
00:22:53,152 --> 00:22:55,120
you're still no more
than a blade of grass.

229
00:22:57,000 --> 00:22:58,440
I wasn't like this before.

230
00:22:58,800 --> 00:23:00,400
And you're not the only thing I fear.

231
00:23:01,119 --> 00:23:03,319
Now I fear everything in this desert.

232
00:23:04,512 --> 00:23:05,790
And the fear keeps growing.

233
00:23:07,920 --> 00:23:08,960
Yu Hou,

234
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:11,960
whatever you fear,

235
00:23:12,720 --> 00:23:14,599
you kill, huh?

236
00:23:16,240 --> 00:23:17,400
That's human nature.

237
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:20,000
Aren't you the same?

238
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:23,160
My men

239
00:23:23,759 --> 00:23:25,480
will return to Liangzhou with you.

240
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:27,039
Why?

241
00:23:27,599 --> 00:23:29,839
I issued
the Zhang family's escort contract.

242
00:23:29,960 --> 00:23:31,880
I sent the 200 taels of gold.

243
00:23:32,119 --> 00:23:33,400
I poisoned them, too.

244
00:23:33,640 --> 00:23:35,920
The killings and arson
were all my doing.

245
00:23:36,359 --> 00:23:37,400
The General

246
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:40,016
has been taking medicine
for three months and still won't see me.

247
00:23:40,119 --> 00:23:41,400
And the Embroidered Uniform Guard

248
00:23:41,680 --> 00:23:43,680
has sent the Banner Commander...

249
00:23:44,039 --> 00:23:47,440
I'm afraid you might change
your minds when the time comes.

250
00:23:48,200 --> 00:23:50,359
If you're going to do something,
leave no loose ends.

251
00:23:50,759 --> 00:23:51,839
The Zhang family

252
00:23:52,079 --> 00:23:54,359
must be wiped out completely.

253
00:23:56,640 --> 00:23:57,559
You

254
00:23:57,559 --> 00:23:58,759
don't trust me?

255
00:24:00,200 --> 00:24:02,000
Silencing would put
my mind most at ease.

256
00:24:23,400 --> 00:24:24,680
Does Futu trust you?

257
00:24:25,759 --> 00:24:26,640
I don't know.

258
00:24:27,400 --> 00:24:28,759
Then you need to earn his trust.

259
00:24:30,319 --> 00:24:31,160
Of course.

260
00:25:11,140 --> 00:25:14,980
(Zhang Escort Agency)

261
00:26:59,799 --> 00:27:01,799
(Zhang Escort Agency)
Two hundred taels in total.

262
00:27:01,799 --> 00:27:02,799
Pure gold.

263
00:27:03,759 --> 00:27:06,440
All 27 members of the victim's
household have been buried.

264
00:27:07,599 --> 00:27:09,359
The sun is scorching.

265
00:27:09,360 --> 00:27:11,056
The bodies couldn't be kept any longer.

266
00:27:12,039 --> 00:27:13,160
As for this gold,

267
00:27:13,559 --> 00:27:14,759
no one has come to claim it.

268
00:27:15,440 --> 00:27:16,440
It wasn't registered,

269
00:27:16,720 --> 00:27:18,160
nor was it entered into any records.

270
00:27:18,640 --> 00:27:20,640
Officer Pu, you may take it.

271
00:27:23,559 --> 00:27:24,559
What do you mean?

272
00:27:26,000 --> 00:27:27,640
Officer Pu,

273
00:27:27,640 --> 00:27:30,599
you've come all this way
from the Capital.

274
00:27:31,279 --> 00:27:33,960
And you have a long journey back.

275
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:38,559
And I take this gold back?

276
00:27:38,799 --> 00:27:40,559
It's only right that you do so.

277
00:28:16,440 --> 00:28:18,160
I just got here.

278
00:28:19,000 --> 00:28:22,359
I came to investigate the incidents
at Lieyang Well and Shiquan Fort.

279
00:28:23,039 --> 00:28:26,200
Now there's also the massacre
of the Zhang Escort Agency.

280
00:28:28,599 --> 00:28:30,599
They're all dead now.

281
00:28:31,039 --> 00:28:32,799
It's so hot.

282
00:28:33,079 --> 00:28:35,359
Lieyang Well and Shiquan Fort
are even hotter.

283
00:28:36,119 --> 00:28:37,599
There's no need to go there.

284
00:28:40,079 --> 00:28:41,279
What's your position?

285
00:28:41,759 --> 00:28:42,759
Coroner.

286
00:28:43,240 --> 00:28:44,440
My surname is Chi.

287
00:28:45,960 --> 00:28:48,119
You can call me Chi

288
00:28:48,119 --> 00:28:50,039
or Coroner Chi.

289
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:52,519
Coroner...

290
00:29:08,519 --> 00:29:10,680
Is this how you
handle things around here?

291
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:12,599
You're just giving me 200 taels of gold?

292
00:29:12,720 --> 00:29:14,759
Do you know how much I earn in a year?

293
00:29:15,200 --> 00:29:16,640
I'm not exactly giving it to you.

294
00:29:16,799 --> 00:29:19,319
I'm simply asking you
to take it with you.

295
00:29:19,319 --> 00:29:22,200
I'm a seventh-rank Banner Commander
of the Embroidered Uniform Guard.

296
00:29:22,440 --> 00:29:25,200
I've traveled all the way
from the Capital to Gansu.

297
00:29:25,799 --> 00:29:28,160
I can understand the Commander-in-Chief
not showing himself.

298
00:29:28,160 --> 00:29:30,890
But where is the Deputy Military
Commissioner of the Liangzhou Guard?

299
00:29:31,160 --> 00:29:33,640
Instead, a coroner like you
comes here to speak to me.

300
00:29:34,640 --> 00:29:36,559
Do you have a death wish?

301
00:29:37,480 --> 00:29:38,640
Officer Pu,

302
00:29:39,039 --> 00:29:40,880
how much do you earn in a year?

303
00:29:42,839 --> 00:29:44,000
2,678 kg of rice.

304
00:29:44,799 --> 00:29:46,200
That's worth 40 taels of silver.

305
00:29:48,519 --> 00:29:50,680
Well, these 200 taels of gold

306
00:29:51,640 --> 00:29:54,400
shouldn't seem
too little to you, Officer Pu.

307
00:30:19,960 --> 00:30:21,640
I've never heard

308
00:30:21,640 --> 00:30:23,039
of a coroner

309
00:30:23,680 --> 00:30:25,720
being sent to give me 200 taels of gold.

310
00:30:25,720 --> 00:30:27,680
What's the Deputy
Military Commissioner's name?

311
00:30:28,200 --> 00:30:29,119
Yu Hou.

312
00:30:30,079 --> 00:30:31,279
Tell him to come here!

313
00:30:32,680 --> 00:30:33,839
What about this gold?

314
00:30:33,839 --> 00:30:35,559
Leave the gold right here.
Don't touch it.

315
00:30:35,559 --> 00:30:37,519
If he isn't here within an hour,

316
00:30:37,799 --> 00:30:38,920
I'll give you a slash.

317
00:30:39,160 --> 00:30:39,880
Seriously?

318
00:30:39,880 --> 00:30:41,200
I'll give you a slash.

319
00:30:41,264 --> 00:30:43,120
And you'll have taken it for nothing.

320
00:30:56,740 --> 00:31:01,580
(Deputy Military
Commissioner's Residence)

321
00:31:08,440 --> 00:31:09,200
Deputy,

322
00:31:10,559 --> 00:31:13,079
we've found the surviving escort
from the Zhang family.

323
00:31:25,319 --> 00:31:26,160
Bring him here.

324
00:31:27,200 --> 00:31:28,359
There's a bit of trouble.

325
00:31:29,720 --> 00:31:30,839
He attacks anyone he sees.

326
00:31:31,759 --> 00:31:33,279
Bring him here, dead or alive.

327
00:31:36,860 --> 00:31:41,500
(Yu Residence)

328
00:33:00,480 --> 00:33:01,440
What is it?

329
00:33:01,456 --> 00:33:04,150
The coroner is asking you to come over,
Deputy Military Commissioner.

330
00:33:04,160 --> 00:33:05,000
Why?

331
00:33:05,790 --> 00:33:08,608
A Capital Embroidered Uniform Guard
is at the Zhang Escort Agency.

332
00:33:11,279 --> 00:33:12,240
I'm not going.

333
00:33:12,288 --> 00:33:14,800
The Embroidered Uniform Guard officer
will leave eventually.

334
00:33:21,648 --> 00:33:24,000
As a coroner, just tell us
what a coroner should.

335
00:33:24,279 --> 00:33:26,359
How did the 27 members
of the Zhang family die?

336
00:33:26,519 --> 00:33:27,559
Poisoning.

337
00:33:27,559 --> 00:33:29,599
They hacked each other to death.

338
00:33:29,680 --> 00:33:30,359
What poison?

339
00:33:30,359 --> 00:33:31,799
The horse feed was poisoned.

340
00:33:32,000 --> 00:33:34,839
The same thing happened
at Lieyang Well and Shiquan Fort.

341
00:33:34,839 --> 00:33:36,799
We don't know exactly
what poison it was.

342
00:33:36,800 --> 00:33:38,656
Is there any
of the poisoned horse feed left?

343
00:33:40,359 --> 00:33:42,200
There might be a little left.

344
00:33:42,759 --> 00:33:43,559
Bring it here.

345
00:34:14,920 --> 00:34:15,760
Careful, Coroner Chi.

346
00:34:15,760 --> 00:34:17,039
It's fine.

347
00:34:17,360 --> 00:34:18,000
Go.

348
00:34:43,376 --> 00:34:44,920
I won't get poisoned, will I?

349
00:34:46,039 --> 00:34:48,440
Well, I haven't been poisoned.

350
00:34:52,079 --> 00:34:54,320
Officer Pu, you probably didn't expect

351
00:34:54,320 --> 00:34:56,039
it to be this hot here, right?

352
00:34:56,400 --> 00:34:58,559
Why don't you take off your outer robe?

353
00:35:00,519 --> 00:35:02,639
This is my first assignment
away from the Capital.

354
00:35:02,639 --> 00:35:03,679
I never expected

355
00:35:03,800 --> 00:35:06,199
people down here
to handle things so brazenly.

356
00:35:06,519 --> 00:35:08,239
Is that good or bad?

357
00:35:31,632 --> 00:35:33,792
Is the Deputy
Military Commissioner of Liangzhou

358
00:35:33,800 --> 00:35:34,920
coming or not?

359
00:35:36,559 --> 00:35:38,559
Of the Ming's nine major
frontier garrisons,

360
00:35:39,679 --> 00:35:42,559
this Regional Military Commission
oversees 12 guards and four battalions.

361
00:35:42,740 --> 00:35:45,024
The Commander-in-Chief
holds command over the Northwest.

362
00:35:45,030 --> 00:35:46,280
He's the deity of the Northwest.

363
00:35:46,280 --> 00:35:47,760
I didn't ask about the General.

364
00:35:48,519 --> 00:35:51,440
Is the petty Liangzhou Deputy
Military Commissioner coming?

365
00:35:53,248 --> 00:35:55,630
The Deputy Military Commissioner
is no petty official.

366
00:35:58,639 --> 00:35:59,719
And this gold

367
00:35:59,840 --> 00:36:01,159
is no small sum either.

368
00:36:17,400 --> 00:36:19,199
It's like a dream.

369
00:36:20,239 --> 00:36:22,360
Under this scorching sun,

370
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:25,840
sometimes it really
does feel like a dream.

371
00:36:30,079 --> 00:36:31,719
Now, it's just you and me.

372
00:36:33,079 --> 00:36:34,400
We'll split

373
00:36:34,760 --> 00:36:36,159
the 200 taels of gold equally.

374
00:36:50,480 --> 00:36:52,400
I'm not lucky enough
to enjoy such a fortune.

375
00:37:04,239 --> 00:37:06,480
Officer Pu,
you've finally come around?

376
00:37:06,960 --> 00:37:07,800
I'm leaving.

377
00:37:09,639 --> 00:37:11,360
Have a safe journey.

378
00:37:11,408 --> 00:37:13,390
If the Deputy Military Commissioner
won't come,

379
00:37:13,400 --> 00:37:14,679
I'll go find him myself.

380
00:37:32,159 --> 00:37:33,199
Officer Pu,

381
00:37:33,199 --> 00:37:35,199
what are you doing?

382
00:38:03,119 --> 00:38:04,000
Don't move!

383
00:38:05,480 --> 00:38:06,679
Don't harm him!

384
00:38:06,688 --> 00:38:08,416
The poison in the feed is taking effect.

385
00:38:11,320 --> 00:38:12,039
Officer Pu,

386
00:38:12,400 --> 00:38:13,519
put your blade away.

387
00:38:16,240 --> 00:38:17,712
It's the poison from the feed.

388
00:38:30,519 --> 00:38:32,480
It's me!

389
00:38:38,159 --> 00:38:38,800
Go

390
00:38:38,960 --> 00:38:40,119
seal the entrance.

391
00:38:40,199 --> 00:38:42,119
This room is sturdy. Lock him inside.

392
00:38:42,119 --> 00:38:42,840
Yes.

393
00:39:31,119 --> 00:39:32,079
What is it?

394
00:39:32,960 --> 00:39:33,920
The dancer is here.

395
00:39:50,320 --> 00:39:51,719
My name is Liu Rusi.

396
00:39:53,440 --> 00:39:56,079
The dancer who used to dance
for you has gone back south.

397
00:39:56,239 --> 00:39:57,079
She just left.

398
00:40:02,599 --> 00:40:04,159
I dance better than she does.

399
00:40:06,199 --> 00:40:07,079
Who are you?

400
00:40:18,000 --> 00:40:19,440
Liu Rusi.

401
00:40:22,280 --> 00:40:23,599
I'm one of Futu's people.

402
00:40:29,320 --> 00:40:30,920
We all serve the General.

403
00:40:31,960 --> 00:40:32,920
Why make a distinction?

404
00:40:34,000 --> 00:40:35,960
Futu serves the General.

405
00:40:36,119 --> 00:40:37,599
I serve Futu.

406
00:40:38,119 --> 00:40:39,079
And now,

407
00:40:41,280 --> 00:40:42,719
I'm dancing for you.

408
00:40:49,840 --> 00:40:52,920
Deputy Military Commissioner, do you
prefer Guanshaan's battles

409
00:40:53,079 --> 00:40:54,079
or do you prefer

410
00:40:54,079 --> 00:40:55,880
Huainan's pleasures?

411
00:40:59,039 --> 00:41:00,079
Huainan's pleasures.

412
00:41:01,039 --> 00:41:02,280
I like them, too.

413
00:42:25,312 --> 00:42:26,432
Deputy Military Commissioner,

414
00:42:26,464 --> 00:42:28,736
were your eyes
closed the whole time just now?

415
00:42:29,800 --> 00:42:30,679
You may leave.

416
00:42:31,960 --> 00:42:33,760
If you don't like it,

417
00:42:34,320 --> 00:42:35,840
I can wait outside.

418
00:42:38,639 --> 00:42:39,519
Wait for what?

419
00:42:43,239 --> 00:42:44,159
What is it?

420
00:43:01,360 --> 00:43:02,519
My name is Zhang Luyao.

421
00:43:06,340 --> 00:43:09,380
(Preview of the Next Episode)

422
00:43:10,119 --> 00:43:11,119
My name is Zhang Luyao.

423
00:43:11,296 --> 00:43:13,510
You drugged the guards
and entered without permission.

424
00:43:13,552 --> 00:43:14,944
You've got some nerve.

425
00:43:14,960 --> 00:43:17,320
How did the 27 members of my family die?

426
00:43:17,679 --> 00:43:19,480
Who gave the Zhangs the escort contract?

427
00:43:20,016 --> 00:43:22,590
Whoever is willing to risk their life
and head west with me

428
00:43:22,599 --> 00:43:24,960
to meet
the murderous guardians of the gold

429
00:43:25,360 --> 00:43:27,159
gets these 200 taels of gold.

430
00:43:27,159 --> 00:43:29,119
(Zhang Escort Agency)
What escort job can a woman take on?

431
00:43:29,119 --> 00:43:30,460
Her martial arts are exceptional.

432
00:43:30,470 --> 00:43:31,510
How exceptional?

433
00:43:36,680 --> 00:43:41,680
=Remnants of Gold=
